			<item>
				<title>Playground</title>
				<link>https://trust-lang.net/en/docs/sandbox/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://trust-lang.net/en/docs/sandbox/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-the-playground-is&#34;&gt;What the playground is&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#what-the-playground-is&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;playground&lt;/strong&gt; is an interactive web page where you can write TrustLang code&#xA;directly in the browser and immediately see the generated result of transpilation to C++.&#xA;It is a &amp;ldquo;live&amp;rdquo; example of the language with a built-in editor and code highlighting, selection of examples from a list,&#xA;output of diagnostic messages, cross-navigation between the code and C++, and a button to download the resulting build archive.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Status and plans</title>
				<link>https://trust-lang.net/en/docs/status/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://trust-lang.net/en/docs/status/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;implemented-in-the-current-version-060&#34;&gt;Implemented in the current version (0.6.0)&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#implemented-in-the-current-version-060&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; The &lt;a href=&#34;https://trust-lang.net/en/docs/syntax/concept/&#34;&gt;syntax concept&lt;/a&gt; has been developed&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; The &lt;a href=&#34;https://trust-lang.net/en/docs/syntax/macros/&#34;&gt;macro syntax&lt;/a&gt; has been defined&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; Parser and literals for &lt;a href=&#34;https://trust-lang.net/en/docs/types/&#34;&gt;basic data types&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; The concept of &lt;a href=&#34;https://trust-lang.net/en/docs/safety/&#34;&gt;language guarantees&lt;/a&gt; has been formulated&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; The &lt;a href=&#34;https://trust-lang.net/en/docs/sandbox/&#34;&gt;playground&lt;/a&gt; for testing examples has been developed&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
			</item>
